body:
**Summary**
Adds client side tool support to React and JS.

React usage:

```jsx
<Chat
  // ...
  tools={[
    type: 'tool-name',
    component: () => <div>Tool Rendered</div>
  ]}
/>
```

Javascript usage:

```javascript
chat({
  // ...
  tools: [
    {
      type: 'tool-name',
      template: {
        component: (_, { html }) => html`<div>Tool rendered</div>`,
      },
    },
  ],
}),
```
